# ---------------------------------------------------------------- AdvSIMD loads and stores
# multiple structures: opcode 0000 four registers (LD4), 0010 LD1 x4, 0100 LD3, 0110 LD1 x3, 0111 LD1 x1, 1000 LD2, 1010 LD1 x2
